<!-- wp:group {"className":"rivage-page-intro rivage-wrap","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group rivage-page-intro rivage-wrap"><!-- wp:post-title {"level":1} /--><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A clear path from a request to a personally confirmed stay.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"rivage-wrap rivage-section","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group rivage-wrap rivage-section"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">A fictional hotel demonstration.</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Requests on this website are for demonstration only. No real accommodation is reserved and no payment is taken. Please use test details.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Your request and confirmation.</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Choose your dates and a category, then verify your email using the link sent to you. The link expires after 30 minutes. Pending requests do not hold a room. The hotel assigns an available physical room and emails you when it confirms or declines the request.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Arrivals, departures and guests.</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Arrival is from 14:00 and departure before 11:00, Madagascar time. Each room requires at least one adult. Guests aged 12 or older count as adults; children are aged 0–11. Category limits and total capacity apply.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Demo pricing and changes.</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The quoted total is the nightly category rate multiplied by the number of nights, with no additional charges in this version. No online payment is collected. The quote is kept with the request. Stays can be 1–30 nights, with arrival within one year.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The hotel handles changes and cancellations. An administrative cancellation releases the dates and triggers an email. Reply to the hotel notification for assistance.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group -->
